{"4815660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brassfang", "steam_appid": 4815660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4816530], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815660/extras/e9ed15c80da0578723ba453030844baa.avif?t=1781188823\" alt=\"\"width=780 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Awaken in a Castle of Experiments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken in a castle where vampiric blood and steampunk machinery have become one. Fight through twisted experiments, uncover hidden secrets, and discover the truth behind the forces reshaping your body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815660/extras/42881a6074a47515aa5907375ee8dd4a.avif?t=1781188823\" alt=\"\"width=370 height=200 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815660/extras/6d01a6304ce7461a58a712de57cbc963.avif?t=1781188823\" alt=\"\"width=370 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Own Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape every run through randomized upgrade choices. Combine vampiric powers and mechanical enhancements to create unique builds, discover powerful synergies, and adapt your playstyle as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815660/extras/1a4cbfc4755f3f91071c88c6831439d7.avif?t=1781188823\" alt=\"A level-up screen displaying four upgrade cards. Each card shows a different ability enhancement, including icons, rarity colors, and effect descriptions. The player can choose one upgrade to improve their character&#039;s combat capabilities.\" width=370 height=200 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815660/extras/b4c618d4b7d6f5312d3c0fac11f1b9e9.avif?t=1781188823\" alt=\"A new ability selection screen displaying three skill cards. Each card shows a different combat ability, including an icon, description, and preview image. The player can choose one ability to expand their combat options.\" width=370 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Fight, and Evolve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interconnected areas, defeat challenging bosses, and unlock new ways to grow stronger. Choose between embracing your vampiric nature or the machine replacing it, leading to multiple endings and different paths of progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explore a dark steampunk castle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Create unique builds through randomized upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Combine vampiric and mechanical abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Defeat powerful bosses and enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Discover multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815660/extras/4c60743b6e524ea7727b7dc52ed980f8.avif?t=1781188823\" alt=\"\"width=780 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815660/extras/e9ed15c80da0578723ba453030844baa.avif?t=1781188823\" alt=\"\"width=780 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Awaken in a Castle of Experiments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken in a castle where vampiric blood and steampunk machinery have become one. Fight through twisted experiments, uncover hidden secrets, and discover the truth behind the forces reshaping your body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815660/extras/42881a6074a47515aa5907375ee8dd4a.avif?t=1781188823\" alt=\"\"width=370 height=200 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815660/extras/6d01a6304ce7461a58a712de57cbc963.avif?t=1781188823\" alt=\"\"width=370 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Own Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape every run through randomized upgrade choices. Combine vampiric powers and mechanical enhancements to create unique builds, discover powerful synergies, and adapt your playstyle as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815660/extras/1a4cbfc4755f3f91071c88c6831439d7.avif?t=1781188823\" alt=\"A level-up screen displaying four upgrade cards. Each card shows a different ability enhancement, including icons, rarity colors, and effect descriptions. The player can choose one upgrade to improve their character&#039;s combat capabilities.\" width=370 height=200 /></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4815660/extras/b4c618d4b7d6f5312d3c0fac11f1b9e9.avif?t=1781188823\" alt=\"A new ability selection screen displaying three skill cards. Each card shows a different combat ability, including an icon, description, and preview image. The player can choose one ability to expand their combat options.\" width=370 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, Fight, and Evolve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interconnected areas, 